{"seq":11,"slug":"data-engineering-pipelines","title":"数据工程与数据管道","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines","rating":{"composite":4.18,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 数据工程与数据管道 简介\n\n任何依赖数据的系统，最终都站在一条看不见的传送带上：数据从业务库、日志、第三方接口与设备源源不断地产生，要被可靠地搬运、存下来、加工成可用的形态，再交给分析、报表和模型去消费。这个 hub 讲的就是这条传送带本身——数据工程，关注的是数据如何被「可靠地」摄取、存储、处理与治理，而不是数据被取出来之后的统计与建模。它与 31_data-science 下其他偏分析、偏算法的 hub 互补：那些 hub 假设手里已经有一份干净、及时、可信的数据，而这份干净、及时、可信，正是数据工程要负责造出来的。\n\n为什么这件事值得单独成 hub？因为在真实系统里，模型和分析的上限往往不取决于算法多先进，而取决于数据有没有按时到、有没有重复或丢失、口径会不会在某次上游改动后悄悄漂移。一条设计粗糙的管道会让下游所有人都为脏数据买单，而且故障常常在事后很久才被发现。把摄取、存储、计算、编排、质量这几件事当成工程问题认真对待，是让数据真正可用、可信、可规模化的前提。\n\n整个 hub 按数据流动的自然顺序铺开，分四章。第一章「数据管道基础」打地基：批处理与流处理的取舍、ETL 与 ELT 的演变，以及常见的摄取模式，帮你建立对一条管道整体形态的判断力。第二章「数据存储架构」回答数据落在哪里：从数据仓库到数据湖与湖仓一体，再到 Iceberg、Delta 这类开放表格式如何把仓库的可靠性带给湖。第三章「流式数据处理」进入实时世界：主流流处理引擎、exactly-once 语义与水位线如何应对乱序和重复，以及用 CDC 与事件流让数据在产生的瞬间就开始流动。第四章「编排与数据质量」收口：用工作流编排把零散任务串成可靠的有向流程，用数据质量与可观测性守住可信度，并借助数据建模与 dbt 把转换逻辑工程化。\n\n建议按章顺序通读，先建立从源头到消费的全局脉络，再回到具体技术做深挖。读完你应当能判断一条管道该选什么形态、数据该如何分层落地、实时与批量如何分工，以及怎样让这一切在出问题时被及时发现并修复。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-pipeline-foundations","title":"数据管道基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-pipeline-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"batch-vs-streaming","title":"批处理与流处理","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-pipeline-foundations/batch-vs-streaming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"etl-vs-elt","title":"ETL 与 ELT","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-pipeline-foundations/etl-vs-elt"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-ingestion-patterns","title":"数据摄取模式","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-pipeline-foundations/data-ingestion-patterns"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-storage-architecture","title":"数据存储架构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-storage-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-warehouse-fundamentals","title":"数据仓库基础","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-storage-architecture/data-warehouse-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-lake-and-lakehouse","title":"数据湖与湖仓一体","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-storage-architecture/data-lake-and-lakehouse"},{"seq":3,"slug":"table-formats-iceberg-delta","title":"开放表格式：Iceberg 与 Delta","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/data-storage-architecture/table-formats-iceberg-delta"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"streaming-data-processing","title":"流式数据处理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/streaming-data-processing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stream-processing-engines","title":"流处理引擎 Flink 与 Spark","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/streaming-data-processing/stream-processing-engines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exactly-once-and-watermarks","title":"精确一次与水位线","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/streaming-data-processing/exactly-once-and-watermarks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cdc-and-event-streaming","title":"CDC 与事件流","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/streaming-data-processing/cdc-and-event-streaming"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"orchestration-and-data-quality","title":"编排与数据质量","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/orchestration-and-data-quality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"workflow-orchestration","title":"工作流编排：Airflow 与 Dagster","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/orchestration-and-data-quality/workflow-orchestration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-quality-and-observability","title":"数据质量与可观测性","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/orchestration-and-data-quality/data-quality-and-observability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-modeling-and-dbt","title":"数据建模与 dbt","url":"/h/data-science/data-engineering-pipelines/orchestration-and-data-quality/data-modeling-and-dbt"}]}]}